cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BML in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "BML: a 2026 Standard ML in plain JavaScript"
abstract: >-
  BML is a 2026 Standard ML implemented in plain JavaScript: lexer, parser,
  Hindley-Milner type inference and Basis Library, with no build step and no
  dependencies. Based on Standard ML as developed by Robin Milner, Mads Tofte and
  Robert Harper.
type: software
authors:
